WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening. Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.801
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:06.033
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:08.300
President Biden signed
an executive order yesterday

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.834
limiting
the government's ability

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.434
to use commercial spyware

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:13.467
that could be used
to hack citizens' phones

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:16.601
or, as he put it,
"We're going back to landlines."

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.934
The Manhattan grand jury
investigating allegations

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:22.100
that former President Trump

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.934
made illegal hush money payments
met yesterday

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:26.868
without voting
on a criminal indictment.

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:29.634
Okay. In the words
of Stormy Daniels,

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.534
what is taking so long?

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.501
Look, until we see
that perp walk,

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.968
I'm just going to have
to keep showing this one.

00:00:37.968 --> 00:00:42.234
♪♪

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:44.400
I do hope...

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.968
When he does have his perp walk,

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:47.734
I do hope they play
that brass band.

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:51.534
Former President Trump
was interviewed last night

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:53.133
by Fox News host Sean Hannity.

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.334
"Thanks for having me back,"

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.000
said Hannity and Trump
at the same time.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:00.601
In a new interview with
Fox News host Sean Hannity,

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.167
former President Trump denied

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:04.667
having an affair with
adult film star Stormy Daniels,

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:06.901
which would actually be
a better explanation

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:08.000
for the hush money.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.634
"Don't tell anybody.
We didn't do it."

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:12.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:14.834
In the same interview,
former President Trump claimed

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:16.601
that if
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:20.400
did not win the Republican
gubernatorial primary in 2018,

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.167
he would be working
in a pizza parlor.

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:26.434
Why do I feel like the only jobs
Trump knows are ones from porn?

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:30.000
"If I didn't endorse
Ron right now,

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.934
he would be working as either
a plumber or a stepson."

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.667 --> 00:01:37.234
Trump also said last night

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.334
that he has tapes
of the FBI raid on his

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:40.467
Mar-A-Lago residence,

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:43.234
but he did have to record
over some stuff.

00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:45.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:48.501
Oh, some...
[ Laughs ]

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:51.167
Some sympathy for Eric tonight.

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:54.667
Noted. Noted.

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.601
President Biden called
on Congress yesterday

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.167
to pass an assault weapons ban,

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.367
which is sort of like
calling on McDonald's

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:01.534
to make you a Whopper.

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:03.934
They could do it.
They just won't.

00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.934
Former Vice President Mike Pence

00:02:06.934 --> 00:02:08.667
is set tomorrow
to travel to Iowa,

00:02:08.667 --> 00:02:11.067
which I think is actually
the name of a color

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:12.300
at Sherwin-Williams.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:15.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.667
North Dakota Governor --
[ Applause ]

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:22.701
North Dakota...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:24.901
North Dakota Governor
Doug Burgum

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:27.067
is reportedly considering
running for president.

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:29.300
And if you're wondering
what his chances are,

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.601
that ain't him
and nobody noticed.

00:02:31.601 --> 00:02:34.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.033
[ Applause ]

00:02:37.534 --> 00:02:39.300
I'd vote for that guy though.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.400
That guys does not like --

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.901
seem like he likes the path
this country is on.

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:45.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.567 --> 00:02:47.601
Authorities in California
recently arrested a man

00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:50.968
who allegedly burglarized
several optometry offices.

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:52.634
Witnesses described the subject

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:55.033
as a person between
four and eight feet tall

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:56.167
and very blurry.

00:02:56.167 --> 00:03:00.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:03.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:06.634
They also -- They also thought
that last guy with Doug Burgum.

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.501
And finally today
was National Hot Tub Day,

00:03:10.501 --> 00:03:12.267
except in New York,
where the "jets" don't work.

00:03:12.267 --> 00:03:14.434
And that, you guys...
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:15.734
Oh, come on.

00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:17.234
Come on.

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:19.133
[ Laughs ]

